msgstr "Gracias | Ospace"

#: templates\web\thanks.html
msgid "Thanks for submitting!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por enviarlo!"

#: templates\web\thanks.html
msgid ""
"We've received your application. While you wait for our call, create your "
"driver portal account to upload your documents and sign the driver "
"agreements. It's the fastest way to get approved."
msgstr ""
"Recibimos tu solicitud. Mientras esperas nuestra llamada, crea tu cuenta en "
"el portal del conductor para subir tus documentos y firmar los acuerdos. Es "
"la forma más rápida de ser aprobado."

#: templates\web\thanks.html
msgid "Create my portal account"
msgstr "Crear mi cuenta del portal"

#: templates\web\thanks.html
msgid "Or call us:"
msgstr "O llámanos:"

#: templates\web\thanks.html
msgid ""
"We've received your message and will get back to you shortly, usually within"
" one business day."
msgstr ""
"Recibimos tu mensaje y te responderemos pronto, normalmente en un día hábil."

#: templates\web\thanks.html
